{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "marvm9pwdsuvc7sg", "title": "轻松上手WebSocket及时通信", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"9159dbfe\" id=\"9159dbfe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8160fcf9\" id=\"u8160fcf9\">轻松上手WebSocket及时通信</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uc929231a\" id=\"uc929231a\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u82462fa1\" id=\"u82462fa1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4e09395\" id=\"uf4e09395\">最近想起之前一个及时通信系统项目，是关于订阅推送的，当粉丝订阅了大V或者说作者发布的内容被评论和点赞之后，对应的用户会受到通知，当然，本身系统用户并不多，所以直接采用的是轮训的方式，由前端这边定时向后端发起接口请求，获取消息推送，无疑呢，此种方式也可以解决问题，但是大部分请求基本无用，白白浪费带宽和网络资源。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7b7e666d\" id=\"u7b7e666d\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uef9e3aec\" id=\"uef9e3aec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1cc3daba\" id=\"u1cc3daba\">今天给大家分享下，如何快速让微服务中加入  前后端通过websocket实现消息推送的方式。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u200cb7a0\" id=\"u200cb7a0\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u12181e87\" id=\"u12181e87\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1dd4daaa\" id=\"u1dd4daaa\">WebSocket</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaaaca164\" id=\"uaaaca164\">是一种在单个</span><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/TCP/0?fromModule=lemma_inlink\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u8ebe6e7a\" id=\"u8ebe6e7a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74bfd9da\" id=\"u74bfd9da\">TCP</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u9f5165a6\" id=\"u9f5165a6\">连接上进行</span><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%85%A8%E5%8F%8C%E5%B7%A5/0?fromModule=lemma_inlink\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u109f8c63\" id=\"u109f8c63\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua6b1aff7\" id=\"ua6b1aff7\">全双工</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1e9c8911\" id=\"u1e9c8911\">通信的协议。WebSocket通信协议于2011年被</span><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/IETF/0?fromModule=lemma_inlink\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u97dcf902\" id=\"u97dcf902\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14993f95\" id=\"u14993f95\">IETF</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uc5b4b9f0\" id=\"uc5b4b9f0\">定为标准RFC 6455，并由RFC7936补充规范。WebSocket API也被</span><a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/W3C/0?fromModule=lemma_inlink\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ub4909062\" id=\"ub4909062\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue4d94433\" id=\"ue4d94433\">W3C</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"udf6a918b\" id=\"udf6a918b\">定为标准。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u832047ab\" id=\"u832047ab\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3dde7c73\" id=\"u3dde7c73\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua89924bf\" id=\"ua89924bf\">WebSocket使得客户端和服务器之间的数据交换变得更加简单，允许服务端主动向客户端推送数据。在WebSocket API中，浏览器和服务器只需要完成一次握手，两者之间就直接可以创建持久性的连接，并进行双向数据传输。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud74b9fcd\" id=\"ud74b9fcd\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub618d412\" id=\"ub618d412\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90723721\" id=\"u90723721\">当然，前端这块，主要采用原始的js通过websocket的方式获取消息，在微信公众号和支付宝小程序开发中都有相应的onWebSocekt方式，有兴趣的同学可以自行学习。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud61980a1\" id=\"ud61980a1\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u562537e8\" id=\"u562537e8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2ed1ad9\" id=\"ua2ed1ad9\">废话不多说，开始啃代码。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1cfe5fbd\" id=\"u1cfe5fbd\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6f9b40d9\" id=\"u6f9b40d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf92c9dd5\" id=\"uf92c9dd5\">1、pom.xml</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uff8a7217\" id=\"uff8a7217\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc19c9f22\" id=\"uc19c9f22\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3C!--websocket--%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CgroupId%3Eorg.springframework.boot%3C%2FgroupId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CartifactId%3Espring-boot-starter-websocket%3C%2FartifactId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdependency%3E%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C!--thymeleaf--%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cdependency%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CgroupId%3Eorg.springframework.boot%3C%2FgroupId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CartifactId%3Espring-boot-starter-thymeleaf%3C%2FartifactId%3E%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdependency%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2216147064%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0c41fc8c\" id=\"u0c41fc8c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud1c86871\" id=\"ud1c86871\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"udcf49f4a\" id=\"udcf49f4a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0149d567\" id=\"u0149d567\">2、application.yml</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaa39dc5f\" id=\"uaa39dc5f\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u68d9e9fe\" id=\"u68d9e9fe\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22server%3A%5Cn%20%20port%3A%208080%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnspring%3A%5Cn%20%20thymeleaf%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20cache%3A%20false%20%23%20%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E6%97%B6%E5%85%B3%E9%97%AD%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%2C%E4%B8%8D%E7%84%B6%E6%B2%A1%E6%B3%95%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%9E%E6%97%B6%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%5Cn%20%20%20%20mode%3A%20HTML%20%23%20%E7%94%A8%E9%9D%9E%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%E7%9A%84%20HTML%5Cn%20%20%20%20encoding%3A%20UTF-8%5Cn%20%20%20%20servlet%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20content-type%3A%20text%2Fhtml%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%226ab6eac0%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7cbf34a1\" id=\"u7cbf34a1\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u54f0413a\" id=\"u54f0413a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2252471b\" id=\"u2252471b\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u666ea4c1\" id=\"u666ea4c1\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u06f73163\" id=\"u06f73163\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9bb3f9a\" id=\"ud9bb3f9a\">3、WebSocketServer，实现前后端的长连接</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud877b5aa\" id=\"ud877b5aa\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud031ebb5\" id=\"ud031ebb5\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22package%20com.cookie.server%3B%5Cn%5Cnimport%20org.slf4j.Logger%3B%5Cnimport%20org.slf4j.LoggerFactory%3B%5Cnimport%20org.springframework.stereotype.Component%3B%5Cn%5Cnimport%20javax.annotation.PostConstruct%3B%5Cnimport%20javax.websocket.*%3B%5Cnimport%20javax.websocket.server.ServerEndpoint%3B%5Cnimport%20java.io.IOException%3B%5Cnimport%20java.util.concurrent.CopyOnWriteArraySet%3B%5Cnimport%20java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicInteger%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F**%5Cn%20*%20%40Author%20%3A%20cxq%5Cn%20*%20%40Date%20%3A%202020%2F8%2F31%2015%3A50%5Cn%20*%2F%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E5%89%8D%E7%AB%AF%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E8%AF%A5%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E4%B8%8E%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%AF%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92%5Cn%40ServerEndpoint(value%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fserver%5C%22)%5Cn%40Component%5Cnpublic%20class%20WebSocketServer%20%7B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%40PostConstruct%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20void%20init()%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20System.out.println(%5C%22websocket%20%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20Logger%20log%20%3D%20LoggerFactory.getLogger(WebSocketServer.class)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20final%20AtomicInteger%20OnlineCount%20%3D%20new%20AtomicInteger(0)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20concurrent%E5%8C%85%E7%9A%84%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8Set%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A5%E5%AD%98%E6%94%BE%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%AB%AF%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84Session%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E3%80%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20static%20CopyOnWriteArraySet%3CSession%3E%20SessionSet%20%3D%20new%20CopyOnWriteArraySet%3CSession%3E()%3B%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F**%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%20%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20*%2